---
/** Slide 01 · Cover — The Raise That Stays. */
---

<section data-slot="01" data-variant="rib-p1" class="deck-section deck-glow" style="justify-content: space-between;">
  <header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6">
    <span class="deck-eyebrow">Reach × Lossless · Strategy Pitch</span>
    <span class="deck-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Rural Income Boosts · Draft</span>
  </header>

  <div class="max-w-5xl">
    <p class="deck-eyebrow mb-5" style="color: var(--color-secondary);">What's next, with your gift</p>
    <h1 class="deck-h1">
      The raise <span class="deck-gradient">that stays.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="deck-lede mt-7">
      Rural America's bind is a loop — shortages, low incomes, brain drain.
      The Apprenticeship Degree breaks it at the hinge of income, in place —
      and Arkansas already proved it works.
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6">
    <div class="deck-accent-bar"></div>
    <span class="deck-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">scroll · arrow keys</span>
  </footer>
</section>
